    "Cannot mark the installer as a downloaded file." : {
      "comment" : "Update error. macOS labels files that came from the internet so that it can run its safety checks when they are opened; the app could not apply that label to the update it downloaded. 'Installer' here is the downloaded disk image (.dmg file) that contains the new version of the app.",
