    "Checks contact GitHub. Your archives and extracted files stay on your Mac." : {
      "comment" : "Privacy note (small caption) in the update sheet. 'Checks' is a plural noun - the update checks - and the subject of the first sentence: checking for updates connects to GitHub, the website where the app's releases are published. The second sentence reassures the user that none of their files are uploaded. Keep 'GitHub' and 'Mac' as written. 'Archive' means a compressed file container (like a .zip file) - here an old StuffIt .sit file - not a records archive, an archive room, or a backup.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kontroles kontak GitHub. Jou argiewe en ontpakte lêers bly op jou Mac."
          }
        },
        "am" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "የዝማኔ ፍተሻዎች GitHubን ያገኛሉ። የታመቁና የተፈቱ ፋይሎችዎ Mac ላይ ይቆያሉ።"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تتصل عمليات التحقق بـ GitHub. تبقى ملفاتك المضغوطة والمستخرجة على جهاز Mac الخاص بك."
          }
        },
        "az" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yeniləmə yoxlamaları GitHub ilə əlaqə qurur. Arxivləriniz və çıxarılmış fayllarınız Mac-da qalır."
          }
        },
        "be" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Праверкі звязваюцца з GitHub. Вашы архівы і распакаваныя файлы застаюцца на вашым Mac."
          }
        },
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Проверките се свързват с GitHub. Архивите и извлечените файлове остават на вашия Mac."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "আপডেট চেক GitHub-এ যোগাযোগ করে। আপনার আর্কাইভ এবং এক্সট্র্যাক্ট করা ফাইলগুলো আপনার Mac-এ থাকে।"
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
